ScriptBoard uses these projects:

- MyGo (github.com/egoist/mygo): the native UI toolkit and build tool.
- Lobe MyGo (github.com/lobehub/lobe-mygo): components and design tokens.
- moejs (github.com/MoeForge/moejs): the JavaScript runtime for scripts.
- Lucide icons (icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt, ISC license).

The tvv.tw mirror is a third-party GitHub proxy; ScriptBoard uses it only for
update downloads, and checks every file against the signing key built into
the app.
